IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ea-safety`

-- Electricity Act 2001, ss 2, 6, 79, 80, 82 to 94 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_electricity-act-2001.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 2 -- voltage`

#ASSERT NOT `the voltage is high voltage` `alternating current` 230 230
#ASSERT NOT `the voltage is high voltage` `alternating current` 400 230
#ASSERT NOT `the voltage is high voltage` `alternating current` 1000 600
#ASSERT `the voltage is high voltage` `alternating current` 1001 500
#ASSERT `the voltage is high voltage` `alternating current` 900 601
#ASSERT `the voltage is high voltage` `alternating current` 22000 12700
#ASSERT NOT `the voltage is high voltage` `direct current` 1500 900
#ASSERT NOT `the voltage is high voltage` `direct current` 1200 800
#ASSERT `the voltage is high voltage` `direct current` 1600 800
#ASSERT `the voltage is high voltage` `direct current` 1000 950

